                    "title": "Huge help for nighttime congestion",
                    "url": "https://amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3E9D1Y9W93Z60/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8",
                    "review_text": "I originally picked this up because I kept getting stuffy at night whenever I laid down. Still not sure if it’s allergies from pollen, my cats, or both, but this has helped a ton with opening up my nasal passages and making it easier to breathe while trying to sleep. What I like most is that it gives real relief without going down the slippery slope of constantly using something like Afrin. It works well without that harsh rebound effect you hear about from overusing nasal decongestant sprays. The Kirkland version has honestly been just as effective for me as the big name brands at a way better price, especially considering how many bottles you get in the pack. If you deal with nighttime congestion or seasonal allergies, this is absolutely worth keeping on hand.",
