                    "url": "https://amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1G9BECGLHMRV1/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8",
                    "review_text": "That's much more specific and believable. I'd write it something like this: I've dealt with a stuffy nose for years thanks to Central Texas allergies, and for the longest time I relied on the usual decongestant nasal sprays for relief. I knew Flonase existed, but never wanted to spend the money, and somehow it never occurred to me to look for a generic version. Then a coworker brought me a bottle of Kirkland Aller-Flo to try, and it was honestly life changing! When that bottle finally ran out, I went looking for more online instead of asking her to make another Costco run for me. I was thrilled to find this 5-pack on Amazon for not much more than Costco's price. This spray has made a huge difference for me. It doesn't burn my nostrils the way some sprays do, and I don't experience the rebound effects I got from the decongestant sprays I used before. I also don't find myself needing to use more and more over time to get the same relief. If allergies keep your nose stuffed up year-round, this has definitely been worth it for me.",
